{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7f3c2e1-9b4d-4e8f-c1d2-tkrp-api",
    "name": "TKRP API — функциональные требования (табл. 2.1)",
    "description": "Коллекция для проверки функциональных требований подсистемы БЯМ/RAG (табл. 2.1 ПЗ).\n\n**Для скриншота в ПЗ:** папка **00 Матрица FR** + `npm run test:fr`.\n\n**Запуск API:** `npm run dev:server`; `baseUrl` = http://localhost:3001.\n\nПапки 01, 04–06 — без LLM. Папки 02–03 — с OPENROUTER_API_KEY.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('tkrpTestLib', [",
          "  'function tkrpPostsFromCompetitorsData(d){',",
          "  '  return (d?.competitors||[]).flatMap(c=>Array.isArray(c.posts)?c.posts:[]);',",
          "  '}',",
          "  'function tkrpAssertRequestId(j){ pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"request_id\"); }',",
          "  'function tkrpAssertErrorShape(j){',",
          "  '  pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(false);',",
          "  '  tkrpAssertRequestId(j);',",
          "  '}'",
          "].join('\\n'));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    },
